OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance Sunday services honour
OL,4,Aarmed forces
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people across the South
OL,7,FWest turned out to honour the armed
OL,8,Fforces on Remembrance Sunday.
OL,10,FThose in Devon, Cornwall and the
OL,11,FChannel Islands fell silent for two
OL,12,Fminutes at 11:00 GMT, joining the rest
OL,13,Fof the UK in paying their respects to
OL,14,Fthose who died in past conflicts.
OL,16,FParades and marches were held across
OL,17,Fthe regions, with representatives of
OL,18,Fthe armed forces laying wreaths of
OL,19,Fpoppies.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
