OL,3,GNEWSARemembrance Sunday services honour
OL,4,Aarmed forces
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Plymouth, hundreds lined the Hoe as
OL,7,Fthe Bishop of Exeter, the Rt Revd Dr
OL,8,FMike Harris, led a poignant service at
OL,9,Fthe Royal Naval Memorial.
